{"title":"2012 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/8/378c1b89a5a0c3c3551bd6465f55be249310d835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax + ay = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/d/24d71af8385dc0d359d7b2f01544977591615ab2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Factoring out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/c/86cfbbb6880bebc17c7b5bfd0a48fe16fe91aa95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax + ay$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"16\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/f/56f210f821db2623ae7e028f8bea861e827c374d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(x + y) = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"101\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/d/24d71af8385dc0d359d7b2f01544977591615ab2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/f/56f210f821db2623ae7e028f8bea861e827c374d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(x + y) = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"101\" height=\"20\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/7/a37051e8602db9610cd8e0600f9b6f8b92d39772.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12a = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/5/4a5c590216eed0a58bc942710574ac0f5c2dd938.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{4}{12} = \\boxed{\\frac13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"106\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017230414\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 46/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1809/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.694      1 2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    5.694      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36050:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017230414 and revision id 279736. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}